// The people of settlements: one species per calling, so a player sees who is who
// ("Baker", "Guard"). Settlements place them (settlements.ron `people`), never the land
// (kind Villager); the server keeps them only near players (crates/server/src/villagers.rs).
//
// Every person is drawn from the same body, dressed by their genes: skin by the climate of
// the land about (fairer in the cold), a shirt from their calling's colours, trousers, now
// and then a scarf, and a height of their own. People of one region share a mix, so a
// village's folk look like kin. Their mind is a routine (`Routine`): where their day sends
// them, they go; struck, they run, and the guards come.
